    "badge": "Best Folding Solar Charger",
    "amazonUrl": "",
    "pros": [
      "Largest rated output among the phone-sized folders here",
      "SunPower cells, a respected cell supplier",
      "Three USB ports let you charge a bank and a phone together",
      "Folds into a book-sized package with loops for lashing to a pack",
      "Long track record and widely available"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "USB-A output only on the classic version, so no USB-C fast charging",
      "Heavier and bulkier than the 21W class",
      "Real output in the field sits well below the 28W rating, like every panel"
