            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A 20,000mAh bank stores about 74Wh nominal. After conversion losses, most deliver around 60-70% of that at the port, which works out to roughly three to four full charges for a typical current phone. Larger phones with bigger batteries land toward the lower end, and older or smaller phones toward the higher end."
