            One column we deliberately left out is weight, because published figures vary between versions and listings and we would rather not print a number we cannot stand behind. As a rule, the fabric 21W panels are the lightest way to carry real solar capacity, the Nomad and BioLite trade some weight for a rigid stand, and a 20,000mAh bank weighs more than any of the panels.
