          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best solar power bank is usually two products: a 21-28W folding panel to collect sunlight and a plain 10,000-20,000mAh bank to store it. The BigBlue 28W with an Anker 335 is the pairing we would buy for most people; the Anker 21W suits backpackers, and the BioLite SolarPanel 10+ is the one all-in-one that gets the ratio right.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
